OL,3,GNEWSA'Our business costs are a
OL,4,Anever-ending battle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndependent retailers are urging the
OL,7,Fchancellor to support small businesses
OL,8,Fahead of this year's Budget ` and some
OL,9,Fof them say their futures depend on
OL,10,Fwhether they will be able to deal with
OL,11,Fincreasing costs.
OL,13,F"The overheads have crippled us `
OL,14,Fespecially VAT, business rates and
OL,15,Feverything else that goes with it,"
OL,16,Fsays Sue Westerman, who owns
OL,17,FLincolnshire Flapjack in the North
OL,18,FLincolnshire town of Brigg.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
