OL,3,GNEWSA'Our business costs are a
OL,4,Anever-ending battle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's a similar story on the other side
OL,7,Fof the Humber. Sally Walker, whose
OL,8,Fbusiness, Bright Ideas, is based in
OL,9,FMarket Weighton, East Yorkshire, says:
OL,10,F"We're a retail High Street business,
OL,11,Fand I think [the chancellor] really
OL,12,Fneeds to make sure that these big
OL,13,F[online] companies are paying their
OL,14,Ffair share because it's not an even
OL,15,Fplaying field."
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
