OL,3,GNEWSA'Our business costs are a
OL,4,Anever-ending battle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government says it is aware of cost
OL,7,Fpressures facing some businesses, and a
OL,8,FTreasury spokesperson says: "We're
OL,9,Fmaking the business environment work
OL,10,Fbetter through our #4.3bn business
OL,11,Frates support package, Small Business
OL,12,FPlan and action on late payments."
